--- !u!114 &1291095274
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1291095271}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e52de21a22b6dd44c9cc19f810c65059, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Events:
    m_Signals:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 199844726fdab1e4dbcfbf3240448870, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 062c9fa6135c0044f9080390154058b4, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10b4b99b31543164ba8e0a1116ddca61, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0f2dcc5673a3b9b4a9069ba143728836, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f062103250e00134488cae5dc0d783ab, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94dc80776d5005840875f536650af6e4, type: 2}
    m_Events:
    - m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1291095273}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TalkToAI, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AddPrompt
          m_Mode: 5
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: The users are now working to complete a Homologous
              Recombination (HR). They have access to a scanner by pressing the B
              button on their right controller (Meta Quest 3). They should be looking
              for intact, SCANNABLE DNA pieces, which are highlighted in light blue,
              and positioning those pieces inside the scan pulse. Once they scan
              the template, they need to return to the damage site, where there are
              holograms to show the users where to fill pieces in, and they just
              need to put the pieces back into place. Mutated proteins also spawn,
              and can be destroyed with a laser blaster in the tools menu (B button),
              and will steal the DNA pieces otherwise.
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    - m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1291095273}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TalkToAI, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AddPrompt
          m_Mode: 5
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 'The users have now reached a site with worse damage,
              and need to perform a non-homologous end joining (NHEJ). The first
              step is to cut off the ends with the artemis tool. '
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    - m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1291095273}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TalkToAI, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AddPrompt
          m_Mode: 5
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: The users have done all they can to repair the DNA
              in this cell, but it is too damaged to continue, and must proceed to
              apoptosis. They have been instructed to ask you for a report about
              the damage on the cell and what their next step should be, inform them
              to initiate apoptosis and ask any other questions they may need to
              before the experience ends.
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1291095273}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TalkToAI, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: SetApoptosisInteraction
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    - m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1291095273}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TalkToAI, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AddPrompt
          m_Mode: 5
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 'The users have cut the ends, and now need to position
              DNA pieces in line with the broken ends. Doing this highlights the
              pieces yellow. '
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    - m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1291095273}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TalkToAI, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AddPrompt
          m_Mode: 5
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: They have put at least one piece into place, and now
              need to use the ligase can from the tools menu (B button) to spray
              ligase on the connection point and seal it. They need to bridge the
              two strands according to their colors (dark blue and a more cyan-type
              color) for the task to be complete.
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    - m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1291095273}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TalkToAI, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: SetFirstInteraction
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
